{
  "id": "1CO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "1CO",
  "reference": "1 Bakolinto 6",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlamulwa na banhū abo batī bazunya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we, ni ginehe ūlū ūmò wing'we alī na wilemeelwa na ng'wiye mukūgimaga kūjūlamulwa kū mabanza ga banhū abo batī batūngīlīja, mutūjaga kūlamulwa kū būtongi wa beela? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamanile gīkī a beela bakūbalamula a banhū ba mu sī? Hūna lūūlū īkī mukūbiza balamuji babo a banhū ba mu sī, angū, mutigeleelilwe ū kwīlola ī mihayo ī mido mido? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamanile gīkī na a bamalaika tūkūbalamula? Sumva na mihayo ya mu būpanga ūbū dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nibūlī mukūbatūūlaga banhū abo batī na gwabo ū mu kanisa gīkī babize balamuji bayo ī mihayo yenīyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leki namuwīle gwa kūmudimya minala, hū kūhaya gīkī atīho nūūlū ūmò ū mu bing'we ūyo alī na masala ga kūdūla kwīyitegeleja īyo īkūnkoyaga munhū na ndūgūye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nose munhū akwitwalaga na ndūgūye kūjūlamulwa, nīyo hangī kū būtongi bo banhū abo batī bazunya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nīyo ū mhayo gwa kwishisha kū mabanza gwenūyū, gūloolecha gīkī būlīho būgehelwa būtaale ū mu bing'we! Nibūlī mutūzunyaga hambū hambū nūūlū kwītīlwa ī yabūbi; nūūlū ni kūnyeekejiwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ng'wanya gwaho a bing'we benekīlī hū mukūbīītīlaga yabūbi a banhū, na kūbanyeekeja, nīyo abo mukūbīītīlaga ī yenīyo balī badūgū mulī Seeba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamanile gīkī abo batī batūngīlīja batingīla ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu? Yaya ū kūlemva lemva; a bajingi na a balamya ba mashikolo, na a bashihani, na a bagosha abo bakiyītaga kūbiza gītī bakīma, na a babo bakīītīlaga bagosha bichabo mihayo ya minala; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na a biibi, na a bikūmvi, na a bakolwa walwa, na a badūkani, na a banyeecha, batingīla ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū mu bing'we bamò bing'we ng'walī gīko, alīyo mukoojiwa, ng'wejiwa, ng'ūbalīlwa būtūngīlīja mu lina lya ng'wa Seeba Yesu Kilisito, na mulī Moyo wa ng'wa Mulungu wise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkūjagi Mulungu ū mu bing'we",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū kūlī nene pyī ī shikolo shizunīlīgije,” alīyo h'ītī gīkī pyī shilī na solobo. “Na ng'hana ū kūlī nene pyī ī shose shizunīlīgije,” alīyo shitīko kūnisuga nūūlū shimò shaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī shilīwa shilīho kūlwa kūja mu nda, nī nda īlīho kūlwa shilīwa,” alīyo ū Mulungu akūshīnja pyī būbīlī washo. Ū mīlī gūtīho kūlwa būjingi, gūlīho kūlwa ng'wa Seeba; hūna ū wei alī Seeba wago ū mīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūyo akanjūūcha Seeba, na a bise akūtūjūūcha gīko, kūlwa būdūla bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamanile gīkī ī mibīlī ying'we īlī mabudīka ga mīlī go ng'wa Kilisito? Hama ni ginehe nose nīnje mīlī go ng'wa Kilisito naje nakagūdimanīje ha gwa ng'wa malahya? Yaya gete ī gīko! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo mutamanile gīkī ūyo ūdimana na malahya babizaga mīlī gūmò? Nguno gūhayiwe gīkī, “A babīlī bakūbiza mīlī gūmò.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo ūdimana na Seeba, ū ng'wenūyo wabizaga ūmò nang'hwe ū mu moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we, būpeelagi ū būjingi; shibi shose shose īsho munhū wīta shilī hanze ya mīlī gokwe, alīyo ūlū wīta būjingi, aliyītīla shibi mu mīlī gokwe wei ng'wenekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutamanile gīkī ū mīlī gwing'we gūlī hekalu ya ng'wa Moyo Ng'wela, ūyo mung'wanukūlile kūfuma kūlī Mulungu gīkī ikale mu bing'we? A bing'we mutī sabo ying'we ya benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno mugūlilwe na mpango ntaale; na lūūlū nkūjagi Mulungu ū mu mibīlī ying'we.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.6.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
